auto":"泾州","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8d2884be-db0e-11ef-bfec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"邠州","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8d2884bf-db0e-11ef-b650-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"乾州","place_name_jianti_auto":"干州","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c0-db0e-11ef-9caa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c1-db0e-11ef-aaea-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涇陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"泾阳县","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c2-db0e-11ef-b4c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c3-db0e-11ef-95ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"仲山","place_name_jianti_auto":"仲山","place_note":"陝西泾阳西北境","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c4-db0e-11ef-922a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九嵏","place_name_jianti_auto":"九嵏","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c5-db0e-11ef-8464-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東仲山","place_name_jianti_auto":"东仲山","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8d2884c6-db0e-11ef-b201-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"間，古莧翻。班志：涇水出安定郡涇陽縣西幵頭山，東至馮翊陽陵縣入渭，過郡三，行千六十里。淮南子曰：涇水出薄落之山。華戎對境圖：涇水上接蔚茹水，南流至筓頭山，西折而東流，逕原州、涇州界，又東流逕邠州、乾州之北，又東南流至雍州涇陽縣而合于渭。師古曰：仲山，卽今九嵏之東仲山也。幵，輕煙翻。蔚，紆勿翻。筓，古兮翻。雍，於用翻。嵏，祖紅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"间，古苋翻。班志：泾水出安定郡泾阳县西幵头山，东至冯翊阳陵县入渭，过郡三，行千六十里。淮南子曰：泾水出薄落之山。华戎对境图：泾水上接蔚茹水，南流至筓头山，西折而东流，迳原州、泾州界，又东流迳邠州、干州之北，又东南流至雍州泾阳县而合于渭。师古曰：仲山，即今九嵏之东仲山也。幵，轻烟翻。蔚，纡勿翻。筓，古兮翻。雍，于用翻。嵏，祖红翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ae-db0e-11ef-a2ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8d2884cb-db0e-11ef-b76f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"程大昌","people_name_jianti_auto":"程大昌","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8d2884cc-db0e-11ef-b646-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_na