ame_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ee-db0e-11ef-8f09-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白水縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"白水县","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ef-db0e-11ef-ab6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漆","place_name_jianti_auto":"漆","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f0-db0e-11ef-b851-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沮","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f1-db0e-11ef-a91f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛","start_index":159,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f2-db0e-11ef-a2fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漆","place_name_jianti_auto":"漆","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f3-db0e-11ef-9a79-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沮","place_name_jianti_auto":"沮","start_index":163,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f4-db0e-11ef-ac33-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"並，步浪翻。師古曰：洛水，卽馮翊漆、沮水。程大昌曰：禹貢止有漆、沮，秦、漢以來始有洛水。所謂洛者，班志云：源出北地歸德縣北蠻夷中。今按其水自入塞後，歷鄜、坊、同三州始入渭，孔安國謂自馮翊懷德縣入渭是也。漢懷德、唐同州朝邑縣是也。漆水自華原縣東北同官縣界來，沮水自邠州東北來；洛在漆、沮之東，至同州白水縣與漆、沮合。所謂洛卽漆、沮者，言其本同也。沮，七余翻。鄜，音膚。邠，彼巾翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"并，步浪翻。师古曰：洛水，即冯翊漆、沮水。程大昌曰：禹贡止有漆、沮，秦、汉以来始有洛水。所谓洛者，班志云：源出北地归德县北蛮夷中。今按其水自入塞后，历鄜、坊、同三州始入渭，孔安国谓自冯翊怀德县入渭是也。汉怀德、唐同州朝邑县是也。漆水自华原县东北同官县界来，沮水自邠州东北来；洛在漆、沮之东，至同州白水县与漆、沮合。所谓洛即漆、沮者，言其本同也。沮，七余翻。鄜，音肤。邠，彼巾翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ca-db0e-11ef-b3cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f8-db0e-11ef-900f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f9-db0e-11ef-aed0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：中作，謂用功中道，事未竟也。覺，露也，韓之謀露也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：中作，谓用功中道，事未竟也。觉，露也，韩之谋露也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8d2884f7-db0e-11ef-a493-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d2884fc-db0e-11ef-b000-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8d2884fd-db0e-11ef-98e5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"8d2884fe-db0e-11ef-99d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ff-db0e-11ef-8abe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：注，引也。塡閼，謂壅泥也。言引淤濁之水灌鹹鹵之田，更令肥美，故一畝之收至六斛四斗。杜佑曰：古者百步爲畝，秦、漢以降，卽二百四十步爲畝。閼，讀曰淤，音於據翻。舄，與潟同，音思積翻，鹵也。鹵，亦作滷，音郞古翻，鹹滷。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：注，引也。塡阏，谓壅泥也。言引淤浊之水灌咸卤之田，更令肥美，故一亩之收至六斛四斗。杜佑曰：古者百步为亩，秦、汉以降，即二百四十步为亩。阏，读曰淤，音于据翻。舄，与潟同，音思积翻，卤也。卤，亦作卤，音郞古翻，咸卤。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8d2884fb-db0e-11ef-b19a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"饒，有餘裕也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"饶，有余裕也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"8d288500-db0e-11ef-983a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄭國","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑国","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa78b-db0e-11ef-bd7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭國","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑国","people_xingming":"郑国","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa793-db0e-11ef-8cee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8d2884ad-db0e-11ef-8e37-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xì","source_anchor_text":"閼之水溉舄鹵之地四","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":90,"text":"舄","tongjian_id":"5635a3c9-d737-57d5-b16d-8494c9abc3ab"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","resolved_place_entity_id":301,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa78c-db0e-11ef-b27f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa78d-db0e-11ef-8287-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa78e-db0e-11ef-b233-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涇水","place_name_jianti_auto":"泾水","resolved_place_entity_id":2691,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa78f-db0e-11ef-88fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"仲山","place_name_jianti_auto":"仲山","place_note":"陝西泾阳西北境","resolved_place_entity_id":3565,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa790-db0e-11ef-8e85-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北山","place_name_jianti_auto":"北山","resolved_place_entity_id":1454,"start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa791-db0e-11ef-9791-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛","resolved_place_entity_id":274,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa792-db0e-11ef-95ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa794-db0e-11ef-8193-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","resolved_place_entity_id":301,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa795-db0e-11ef-9489-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa796-db0e-11ef-ae72-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","resolved_place_entity_id":133,"start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8d2aa797-db0e-11ef-a605-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉元鼎六年，左内史倪宽请穿六辅渠，以益溉郑国旁高卬[仰通...","context_before":"...，见高陵县]，过郡三[安定、扶风、冯翊也]，行千六十里。","source_end_index":734,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"80846353-f857-5e6f-9de7-432c2a452538","source_start_index":527,"source_text":"秦始皇初，韩闻秦好兴事，欲罢[音疲]之，毋令东伐。乃使水工郑国间说秦，令凿泾水，自中山[见泾阳县]西抵瓠口为渠[瓠口，《索隐》曰：即谷口。见醴泉县]，并北山，东注洛[北山，即九嵕、嶻嶭诸山]三百余里，欲以溉田。中作而觉，秦欲杀郑国。国曰：始臣为间，然渠成，亦秦之利也。秦以为然，卒使就渠。渠就，用注填阏之水，溉舄卤之地四万余顷，收皆亩一钟[六斛四斗为钟]。于是关中为沃野，无凶年，秦以富强，卒并诸侯。因命曰郑国渠。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2韓欲疲秦人，使無東伐，乃使水工鄭國爲間於秦，鑿涇水自仲山爲渠，並北山，東注洛。中作而覺，秦人欲殺之。鄭國曰：「臣爲韓延數年之命，然渠成，亦秦萬世之利也。」乃使卒爲之。注塡閼之水漑舄鹵之地四萬餘頃，收皆畝一鍾，關中由是益富饒。","content_fanyi":"韩国想使秦人疲敝，使秦国无力向东征伐，于是派水工郑国到秦国做间谍，让秦国从仲山开凿泾水修成水渠，沿北山向东注入洛水。工程进行到中途，秦王发觉了韩国的意图，秦人想杀掉郑国。郑国说：“我虽然是为韩国延长几年国命，但水渠修成后，也是秦国万世的利益。”秦王于是让他继续完成这项工程。这条水渠引含淤泥的水灌溉盐碱地四万多顷，每亩都收获一钟，合六斛四斗，关中地区从此更加富饶。","content_jianti_auto":"2韩欲疲秦人，使无东伐，乃使水工郑国为间于秦，凿泾水自仲山为渠，并北山，东注洛。中作而觉，秦人欲杀之。郑国曰：「臣为韩延数年之命，然渠成，亦秦万世之利也。」乃使卒为之。注塡阏之水漑舄卤之地四万余顷，收皆亩一钟，关中由是益富饶。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":467,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d2884ad-db0e-11ef-8e37-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"元年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"元年","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d2884a7-db0e-11ef-928d-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙卯、前二四六）","year_int":-246},"message":"success","success":true}